{"id": "42e241fa-a4c4-4254-84f5-603c960e266d", "name": "電池温度変化率計算", "description": "総熱入力と冷却能力、および電池の熱容量から温度変化率を計算します。", "inputNames": ["total_heat_input", "cooling_capacity", "battery_heat_capacity"], "outputNames": ["temperature_rate_of_change"], "parameters": {}, "code": "# 温度変化量 = (総熱入力 - 冷却による放熱量) / 熱容量\n# ここでは簡易的に、温度上昇傾向を示す指標を定義\ntemperature_rate_of_change = (total_heat_input - cooling_capacity) / battery_heat_capacity", "language": "python", "simulationKind": "static", "simulationConfig": {}, "stereotypes": [], "metaData": {"version": 1.0, "createdBy": null, "createdDate": "2026-06-25T09:14:59.743590", "ref": null}, "className": "ConstraintBlock"}
