{"id": "5ef87075-f786-4b43-8d3a-aa2b2ab8262f", "name": "導出荷重算出制約", "description": "Totalスライド量と初期拘束荷重から、電池パック構造に発生する導出荷重を計算します。", "inputNames": ["total_slide_amount", "initial_constraint_load"], "outputNames": ["derived_load"], "parameters": {}, "code": "# スライド量、初期拘束荷重、および材料物性定数から導出荷重（圧縮反力）を計算\n# 導出荷重 = 初期拘束荷重 + (Totalスライド量 * 19.1)  (19.1は仮想のバネ定数定数/剛性係数 [kN/mm])\nderived_load = initial_constraint_load + (total_slide_amount * 19.1)", "language": "python", "simulationKind": "static", "simulationConfig": {}, "stereotypes": [], "metaData": {"version": 1.0, "createdBy": null, "createdDate": "2026-06-25T09:14:59.749782", "ref": null}, "className": "ConstraintBlock"}
